WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.350
Wow.

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:05.670
Everything seems to be happening really really
fast now.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:11.220
We just got the news that One Piece will be
going on a four week Hiatus after chapter

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.050
1053 to prepare for the final Saga.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:22.279
And earlier this week I was convinced that
we would still be Wano for a little bit longer

00:00:22.279 --> 00:00:23.900
after all that has happened.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:30.169
But chapter 1052 proved me very wrong.

00:00:30.169 --> 00:00:35.140
After spending almost 2 years on the raid
of Onigashima that literally took place over

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:42.070
the course of a single night, we have just
skipped to a whole week after the battle just

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.070
like that.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:47.010
I was convinced that there was still quite
a bunch of stuff to deal with in Wano, even

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.260
after the defeat of Kaido and Big Mom.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:55.230
How Kaido knew about Joy Boy, Zoro's connection
to Wano, Big Mom's and Kaido's fate.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:01.290
Maybe, since Wano had been taking its time
for the last 4 years, I was kind of expecting

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:07.490
things to wrap up properly and Oda-sensei
taking his time to say goodbye to the land

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:13.969
of the samurai, maybe with a couple of other
little surprises happening after the end of

00:01:13.969 --> 00:01:14.969
the battle.

00:01:14.969 --> 00:01:18.979
But boy, it looks like now that Kaido has
been taken care off, we're trying to get out

00:01:18.979 --> 00:01:20.259
of there asap.

00:01:20.259 --> 00:01:27.030
A quick banquet, some goodbyes and we're off
towards Elbaf, or wherever the story might

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.429
take us next.

00:01:28.429 --> 00:01:34.119
If I sound mad or disappointed about wrapping
up Wano this fast, I'm not.

00:01:34.119 --> 00:01:39.229
But the sudden shift in speed and pacing has
just really caught me off-guard.

00:01:39.229 --> 00:01:43.759
I trust that Oda-sensei will not suddenly
start rushing the story now.

00:01:43.759 --> 00:01:49.499
Him taking some time off to properly prepare
for the final Saga of the story is a very

00:01:49.499 --> 00:01:51.180
good sign I think.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:54.759
And people in Japan seem to think the same
way.

00:01:54.759 --> 00:01:59.840
I actually covered the big announcement by
Oda's editor live on my Twitch channel, if

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.970
you want to check that out, I'll leave a link
in the description below.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:09.100
And basically everyone there, including Luffy's
voice actress Tanaka Mayumi speculated that

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:14.910
there is still quite a lot that has to happen
in the story, given all the foreshadowing

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.660
we have gotten over the years.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:22.670
And anyways, this chapter actually closes
a lot of open plot points, while opening up

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:24.680
a bunch of others.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:30.610
And I actually want to start with the ending
of this chapter, where we finally see admiral

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:37.620
green bull taking action and making his way
to wano, by...fyling through the air using

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:40.849
what looks a lot like a flower as a propeller.

00:02:40.849 --> 00:02:44.930
This is a huge deal in a number of ways.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:51.340
First of all it guarantees that we're about
to see his face revealed for the first time.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:56.160
We're also about to have one of the strongest
characters in the story make an appearance

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.160
in Wano.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:02.370
The flower on his back seems to strongly suggest,
that many of the plant based theories surrounding

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.050
Green Bull were actually true.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:11.410
It has been speculated for a long time now
that Greenbull might have a plant based ability,

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:16.150
based on both the color green and the fact
that he doesn't eat, which might have been

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.030
a hint that the admiral is using photosynthesis.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:28.360
If that's actually true, and this last panel
really seems to suggest it, that could mean

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:34.440
that Greenbull is a plant logia fruit user,
someone who's body is actually made out of

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:41.710
plants, which is why he can survive on sunlight
alone.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:49.390
Even more interesting however, is the question
why he's going to Wano on his own, against

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:54.650
the command of Akainu, who doesn't seem to
have very good control over his admirals,

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.069
if we're being completely honest.

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:59.280
They all just do whatever they like.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:04.780
I don't know about you, but somehow Greenbull
doesn't giver off the vibe, that he's trying

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:06.510
to pick a fight with Luffy and co.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:12.700
If I had to follow my gut feeling, I want
to say that he seems much more excited about

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.280
the fact that Wano has been freed from Kaido's
rule.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:21.090
That would of course tie in wonderfully with
the idea that both Fujitora and Greenbull

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:24.030
are actually citizens of Wano.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:28.000
Former Samurai, that were defeated by Kaido
and joined up with the marines.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:35.880
Not only would that explain Fujitora's Japanese
theme and why he blinded himself, but also

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.270
how the Marines were able to find two such
powerful fighters.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:48.100
Wano is one of the few places on the grand
line were ridiculously powerful people just

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.100
randomly live.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:54.370
There was also speculation that Greenbull
might be either one of the former Daimyo or

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.500
even Zoro's father.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.500
Either of which, let's be real, would be absolutely
epic, if true.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.020
The fact that greenbelt is still on his way
right now, also gives me a bit of hope that

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:11.250
we're not actually gonna leave Wano right
next chapter, but that we still have a bit

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:17.310
more time to say goodbye to the country of
the samurai.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:22.810
Super excited for that and I can't wait to
make a video on Greenbull soon.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:30.020
The next thing we need to talk about is the
Gorosei tasking CP0 with capturing and delivering

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.560
Robin to them.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:37.669
This would be concerning enough by itself,
but what really is worrying me, is that Robin

00:05:37.669 --> 00:05:41.840
is suspiciously absent in this chapter.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:47.300
She's nowhere to be seen 7 days after this
order.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:52.180
The last time we saw her, was when Yamato
introduced herself to the crew.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:57.790
Now however, she's neither with Franky and
Usopp, nor at Luffy's sick bed, nor in the

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:02.540
pretty wild bath house scene, that Oda kindly
enough threw in there for us.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.650
We'll get to that.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:10.340
The fact that Robin is the only straw hat
missing in a chapter, where her kidnapping

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:15.450
has been ordered by the rulers of the world
is pretty disturbing.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:20.840
The messaging of this week has all been about
One Piece moving into it's final Saga, but

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:26.520
next to guaranteed arcs, like Elbaf, Laugh
tale and the final war, also setting up Robin

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.860
getting captured would add quite a bit of
story time on top.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:36.430
No complaints from my side for more one piece,
but rescuing Robin from the hand of the government

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:44.160
again, would be a truly painful task for the
straw hats.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:49.389
Next up we finally know, who actually died
during this battle.

00:06:49.389 --> 00:06:54.650
Even though Kinemon and Kiku seemed to be
as good as dead, both of them puled through

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:55.650
in the end.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:07:01.430
And while I do think that Kinemon dying for
Momo would have been very powerful, and I'm

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:06.160
sure Oda-sensei was thinking about that as
well, but in the end getting to see Kinemon

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:12.020
witness the rebirth of wano and Momo becoming
Shogun is just way to precious.

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:20.699
I'm not quite sure if Kiku permanently lost
that arm or not, but I'm glad she pulled through

00:07:20.699 --> 00:07:21.699
as well.

00:07:21.699 --> 00:07:27.140
The two scabbards that actually have lost
their life for good are Shutenmaru and Izo.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:33.280
We actually get this really sad and emotional
remark by Marco, who can't believed he has

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.830
survived again.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.120
It must be truly painful for him to keep losing
his family.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:44.100
Ace, whitebeard, the men he lost during the
war with Blackbeard.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:48.050
I'm really more than curious to see what Marco
decides to do next.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.699
I really would love to see him travel with
the straw hats honestly.

00:07:51.699 --> 00:07:58.910
I don't necessarily think he will join the
crew as a member, but simply having him accompany

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.890
them for a while would already be awesome.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:06.900
But maybe he will simply stay in Wano for
a while to rest.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:11.230
We also get some really interesting closure
for the remaining supernova.

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.680
Drake and Hawkings have a closing moment.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:22.160
It turns out that the man with a 1% chance
of survival was actually not Luffy, but Hawkings

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.750
himself.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:30.160
He apparently knew that Luffy would succeed
right from the start, but accepted his fate

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.930
for feeling guilty about betraying Kid.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:36.349
And it looks like he actually dies here moments
later.

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:41.990
I think that is a really nice little cathartic
ending for his character, though I will say

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:47.910
that I found Hawkings a little bit underwhelming
as a supernova in this arc.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:55.080
In the end he was someone with hog ambitions,
who didn't have Kid's or Luffy's willpower

00:08:55.080 --> 00:09:02.390
to actually stand up to a YOnko and in the
end payed for it with his life.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.520
Both Kid and Killer seem to have been sending
time at the port with Usopp and Franky, who

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.339
have been fixing up everyone's ship.

00:09:09.339 --> 00:09:11.730
It's really great to see everyone get along.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:17.680
Especially that panel with Killer and Beppo
fanboying over shogun Franky is just the best

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:22.480
thing ever.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:25.970
What really caught me off-guard in this chapter
was Apoo.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:31.890
Like I am very much on board for getting the
new bounties most likely in the next chapter.

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:37.529
In fact I'm working on my own bounty myself
right now, trying to overtake Trebol's 99M.

00:09:37.529 --> 00:09:44.190
If you subscribe, you raise my own bounty
by 100 Berries each and we're almost at 60M.

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:50.010
That's of course nothing compared to what
Luffy and the other straw hats will get after

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:52.310
taking down two Yonko.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:10:00.600
And I'm also really curious to see who will
get the title of an emperor next to Luffy.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:03.640
Will it be both Kid and Law?

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.470
Or just one of them.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:08.649
After all there were only two Yonko's taken
out.

00:10:08.649 --> 00:10:14.110
Okay I'm getting a bit too excited here about
the upcoming bounty reveal.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:19.560
What I actually wanted to say is, that I find
it very strange that Apoo is just casually

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:24.160
walking up to everyone here and distributing
newspapers.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.860
Maybe defeating Kaido and Big Mom has calmed
Kid's rage about being betrayed a little bit,

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:35.020
but after everything we have learned about
his character you would kind of expect him

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:39.890
to tear Apoo to pieces nonetheless after selling
him out.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:45.390
Kid's reaction seems really off here to me,
but maybe he's just grown that much as a character

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:46.390
during the raid.

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:52.050
Or he's also way too excited about his new
bounty to still care about Apoo in that moment.

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:57.970
And then we of course HAVE to discuss the
preparations for the big festival.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:04.360
First of all, I'm still over the moon that
Yamato is pretty much confirmed to be a straw

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.360
hat at this point.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:10.740
7 days after the battle, and everyone in the
crew seems to love her and treat her as a

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.180
member already.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:17.790
The fact that she refused to eat and move
for a week in order to pray for Luffy's health

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.670
is just the cutest and most loyal thing ever.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:28.520
It's like a mini version of Zoro's sacrifice
and willingness to suffer for his captain.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.520
Love it.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:32.310
The way she rushes in an hugs Luffy is also
pure gold.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:38.020
The entire sequence feels very much like something
that could take place on the sunny.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:43.240
Momo trying to pull his usual move with Nami
as expected and getting the Sanji treatment

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.490
for it.

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:49.410
Yamato placing a place on momo's head actually
has him look exactly like his father.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.089
I'm a real sucker for stupid stuff like that.

00:11:52.089 --> 00:11:53.490
Just my type of humour.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:59.000
We get a second serving of the bathhouse scene,
and honestly I think at this point Oda-sensei

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:07.240
is either just living out his wildest fantasies
with Yamato or just trolling all of us really

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.240
badly.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:14.390
Yamato, as Oden, joins all the guys in the
men's section of the bathhouse, which has

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:17.899
the expected effect on Brook and Sanji.

00:12:17.899 --> 00:12:22.450
And in general there is a lot of boob in this
chapter.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.710
I've honestly given up on trying to figure
out Yamato's pronoun.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:29.800
I'm sticking with the vivre card's she and
my reasoning from the last chapter review,

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:35.339
and I swear I'm not biased at all because
she looks super cute.

00:12:35.339 --> 00:12:40.360
Maybe the biggest surprise of all, next to
Greenbull showing up, and the nudity, and

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:45.280
robin missing....wow this chapter had a lot
in it huh - is the fact that Zoro seems to

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:51.580
have woken up without any repercussions and
with the help of Hiyori, who I'm pretty sure

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.750
admits that she exploited Zoro being unconscious.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:13:03.370
I really hope that we still get an explanation
for the grim reaper figure appearing.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:09.339
And I also really love how Zoro is secretly
relieved that Sanji is back to his old self

00:13:09.339 --> 00:13:12.950
after almost losing his humanity during his
fight with Queen.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:17.890
If you really want to understand why that
was such a major moment for his character

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:21.680
you really should watch my video on that right
here.

